{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MESMALIE </i></strong>is an occult visual novel/point &amp; click adventure where you attempt to tame your\u00a0Magickal ability under the guidance of a small Witches' coven in the middle of nowhere. Heed Mesmer's aloof teachings, strengthen your Magick,\u00a0or just go home,,,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Key features\u00a0-</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short handcrafted point &amp; click narrative,,,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three magickal\u00a0Sessions (only 1 in the demo) with distinct gameplay styles to train your Ability,,,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many interactable objects to practice your Magick on,,,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the story at any point, and jump back into whichever plot beat you like,,,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many, many ending variations, depending on when you decide to step out of the story,,,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enchanting original soundtrack,,,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Controls -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed with primarily the mouse, and light keyboard usage in mind. In the game settings, you can pick keyboard shortcuts for left &amp; right clicking.<br><br><br><i>mesma</i> ,,,</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534790?t=1760383192","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534790/906cf0afe6dc7fcee9a928cf0546a37681ab6d0b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760383192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534790/2e059ae8dd75768b2710482e611f7e1e4a748549/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760383192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534790/2e059ae8dd75768b2710482e611f7e1e4a748549/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760383192","categor